SUMMARY:KidsZone (In-person)
DESCRIPTION:A monthly in-person grief group for children ages 5–12 to express grief\, connect with peers\, and enhance coping skills through themed activities. \nRegistration required. Call 919.719.7199. \nSessions alternate monthly between Thursday evenings (with drop-in dinner at 5:30pm) and Saturday afternoons. \nThursday\, October 15 (6:00–7:30pm)\nSaturday\, November 14 (1:00–3:00pm)\nThursday\, December 17 (6:00–7:30pm)\nSaturday\, January 23 (1:00–3:00pm)
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/kidszone-4/2026-10-15/
LOCATION:Transitions LifeCare\, 250 Hospice Circle\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Grief Support for Adults,Kids Events
