SUMMARY:Make Your Own Condolence Card: Expressive Arts Workshop (In-person)
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever wish that condolence cards felt as unique as your individual loss or name all that you lost when your loved one died? Secondary losses are the many everyday losses caused by the death of a loved one. Whether it’s the loss of income\, purpose\, identity\, or your expected future\, these losses are painful and valid. During this workshop\, you will have the opportunity to learn more about secondary losses and create condolence cards honoring your own unique losses.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/make-your-own-condolence-card-expressive-arts-workshop-in-person/
LOCATION:Transitions LifeCare\, 250 Hospice Circle\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Grief Support for Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Condolence-Card-Workshop.jpeg
